{"id":"wp_rnd_mutiny","category":"military","historical":false,"title":{"en":"Unpaid Troops Mutiny","tr":"Maaşı Ödenmeyen Askerler İsyan Etti"},"text":{"en":"The regiments have gone months without pay. Colonels threaten to sell their muster rolls to the highest bidder, and soldiers have begun to live off the villages around their quarters.","tr":"Alaylar aylardır maaş almadı. Albaylar sayım defterlerini en yüksek teklif verene satmakla tehdit ediyor ve askerler konaklama yerleri çevresindeki köylerden geçinmeye başladı."},"image":"uprising","trigger":{"date_from":{"year":1648,"month":7},"scenarios":["westphalia"],"conds":[{"type":"war_exhaustion_above","value":15}]},"mtth":45,"cooldown":16,"options":[{"id":"pay","name":{"en":"Scrape together the arrears","tr":"Birikmiş borcu bir şekilde öde"},"tip":{"en":"-80 gold, +2 stability","tr":"-80 altın, +2 istikrar"},"effects":[{"type":"gold","value":-80},{"type":"stability","value":2}],"ai_weight":2,"requires":[{"type":"treasury_above","value":80}]},{"id":"disband","name":{"en":"Disband the worst regiments","tr":"En kötü alayları terhis et"},"tip":{"en":"15% of the army disbands, +1 stability","tr":"ordunun %15'i terhis olur, +1 istikrar"},"effects":[{"type":"disband_pct","value":15},{"type":"stability","value":1}],"ai_weight":1},{"id":"allow","name":{"en":"Let the army live off the country","tr":"Ordunun ülkeden geçinmesine izin ver"},"tip":{"en":"-2% population, +3 manpower, -2 stability","tr":"%-2 nüfus, +3 insan gücü, -2 istikrar"},"effects":[{"type":"pop_pct","value":-2},{"type":"manpower","value":3},{"type":"stability","value":-2}],"ai_weight":1}]},
{"id":"wp_rnd_typhus","category":"disaster","historical":false,"title":{"en":"Camp Fever and Typhus","tr":"Kamp Ateşi ve Tifüs"},"text":{"en":"Typhus, called camp fever, moves along the lines of march. Armies that have wintered in devastated country carry it into the next district, where it kills more people than the pikes.","tr":"Kamp ateşi denilen tifüs, yürüyüş hatları boyunca ilerliyor. Harap edilmiş bölgede kışlayan ordular onu bir sonraki bölgeye taşıyor ve orada mızraklardan fazla insan öldürüyor."},"image":"plague","trigger":{"date_from":{"year":1648,"month":7},"scenarios":["westphalia"],"conds":[{"type":"at_war"}]},"mtth":50,"cooldown":12,"options":[{"id":"quarantine","name":{"en":"Isolate the sick and burn bedding","tr":"Hastaları ayır, yatakları yak"},"tip":{"en":"-40 gold, -1 manpower","tr":"-40 altın, -1 insan gücü"},"effects":[{"type":"gold","value":-40},{"type":"manpower","value":-1}],"ai_weight":2,"requires":[{"type":"treasury_above","value":40}]},{"id":"march","name":{"en":"March on and leave the sick","tr":"Yürüyüşe devam et, hastaları bırak"},"tip":{"en":"-5 manpower, +1 prestige","tr":"-5 insan gücü, +1 prestij"},"effects":[{"type":"manpower","value":-5},{"type":"prestige","value":1}],"ai_weight":1},{"id":"physicians","name":{"en":"Pay physicians and apothecaries","tr":"Hekimlere ve eczacılara öde"},"tip":{"en":"-70 gold, -1% population, +1 stability","tr":"-70 altın, %-1 nüfus, +1 istikrar"},"effects":[{"type":"gold","value":-70},{"type":"pop_pct","value":-1},{"type":"stability","value":1}],"ai_weight":1,"requires":[{"type":"treasury_above","value":70}]}]},
{"id":"wp_rnd_refugees","category":"food","historical":false,"title":{"en":"Refugees from the Devastated Provinces","tr":"Harap Edilmiş Eyaletlerden Mülteciler"},"text":{"en":"Villages burned and emptied by years of foraging send their survivors into the towns. Some cultivated acres are lying fallow, but the newcomers bring skills and a need for bread.","tr":"Yıllarca süren iaşe baskınlarıyla yakılıp boşaltılan köylerin hayatta kalanları şehirlere akıyor. Bazı ekili araziler ürünsüz kaldı, ancak yeni gelenler beceri getiriyor ve ekmeğe ihtiyaç duyuyor."},"image":"famine","trigger":{"date_from":{"year":1648,"month":7},"scenarios":["westphalia"],"countries":["HAB","BAV","SAX","BRA","ELR","HES","BSW","MEK","WUR","SWE","LOR"],"conds":[{"type":"provinces_above","value":0}]},"mtth":60,"cooldown":20,"options":[{"id":"settle","name":{"en":"Settle them on empty farms","tr":"Onları boş çiftliklere yerleştir"},"tip":{"en":"-30 gold, +2% population, +3 peasants satisfaction","tr":"-30 altın, %+2 nüfus, köylüler memnuniyeti +3"},"effects":[{"type":"gold","value":-30},{"type":"pop_pct","value":2},{"type":"class_sat","value":3,"class":"peasants"}],"ai_weight":2,"requires":[{"type":"treasury_above","value":30}]},{"id":"workhouses","name":{"en":"Put them to work in the towns","tr":"Onları şehirlerde çalıştır"},"tip":{"en":"+40 gold, -3 peasants satisfaction","tr":"+40 altın, köylüler memnuniyeti -3"},"effects":[{"type":"gold","value":40},{"type":"class_sat","value":-3,"class":"peasants"}],"ai_weight":1},{"id":"turn_away","name":{"en":"Turn them away at the gates","tr":"Kapılardan geri çevir"},"tip":{"en":"+1 stability, -2 prestige","tr":"+1 istikrar, -2 prestij"},"effects":[{"type":"stability","value":1},{"type":"prestige","value":-2}],"ai_weight":1}]},
{"id":"wp_rnd_mercenary_offer","category":"military","historical":false,"title":{"en":"A Colonel Offers His Regiment","tr":"Bir Albay Alayını Sunuyor"},"text":{"en":"An experienced mercenary colonel, whose old paymaster has gone broke, offers his veteran regiment for hire. He is brave, expensive and loyal exactly as long as the money keeps coming.","tr":"Eski ödemecisi iflas etmiş deneyimli bir paralı albay, tecrübeli alayını kiralık olarak sunuyor. Cesur, pahalı ve para geldiği sürece sadık."},"image":"court","trigger":{"date_from":{"year":1648,"month":7},"scenarios":["westphalia"],"countries":["HAB","BAV","SAX","BRA","HES","SWE","FRA","SPA","NLD","VEN","SAV"],"conds":[{"type":"at_war"}]},"mtth":55,"cooldown":16,"options":[{"id":"hire_pike","name":{"en":"Hire the pike-and-shot regiment","tr":"Mızraklı-tüfekli alayı kirala"},"tip":{"en":"-70 gold, +2 pikemen, +1 musketeers","tr":"-70 altın, +2 mızraklı piyade, +1 tüfekli"},"effects":[{"type":"gold","value":-70},{"type":"add_regiments","unit":"pikemen","n":2},{"type":"add_regiments","unit":"musketeers","n":1}],"ai_weight":2,"requires":[{"type":"treasury_above","value":70}]},{"id":"hire_horse","name":{"en":"Hire only his cavalry","tr":"Yalnızca süvarisini kirala"},"tip":{"en":"-50 gold, +2 light cavalry","tr":"-50 altın, +2 hafif süvari"},"effects":[{"type":"gold","value":-50},{"type":"add_regiments","unit":"light_cavalry","n":2}],"ai_weight":1,"requires":[{"type":"treasury_above","value":50}]},{"id":"decline","name":{"en":"Decline politely","tr":"Kibarca reddet"},"tip":{"en":"+1 stability, +1 prestige","tr":"+1 istikrar, +1 prestij"},"effects":[{"type":"stability","value":1},{"type":"prestige","value":1}],"ai_weight":1}]}
